    stg:description """Woman dressed in a long, pleated chiton.  Himation comes over her head beneath a plain calathus.  Offering in her left hand.  Oval face, framed by curly hair.  Long nose bent inward at the tip and a pouting mouth.  Solid clay with an unmodeled back.  Chip on left side.
Fairly soft, play reddish brown clay; traces of white slip and red pigment.""" ;
